\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Nelson-Siegel and Svensson fits to the US Treasury yield curve, most recent trading day.} Points are the Constant Maturity Treasury rates from FRED at ten maturities. Solid line: Nelson-Siegel, RMSE 4.5 basis points. Dashed: Svensson, RMSE 2.9 basis points. Maturity on a log scale.}}{3}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
